stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> ColdBoot: Browser load
    ColdBoot --> AuthGatePending: App.razor renders
    AuthGatePending --> AuthChecking: AuthStateProvider.GetAuthenticationStateAsync
    note right of AuthGatePending
      AuthGate suppresses layout flash
      by rendering <LoginScreen />
      instead of <NotAuthorized>
    end note
    AuthChecking --> UnauthenticatedLayout: Identity?.IsAuthenticated == false
    AuthChecking --> AuthenticatedLayout: Identity?.IsAuthenticated == true
    UnauthenticatedLayout --> LoginScreen: <AuthorizeRouteView> fallback
    LoginScreen --> MicrosoftChallenge: Tap "Sign in with Microsoft"
    LoginScreen --> DevGuestButton: Tap "Continue as Guest" (Dev/Test only)
    DevGuestButton --> DevCookieIssued: /auth/login/fake -> DevCookie
    MicrosoftChallenge --> OidcRoundtrip: /auth/login/microsoft -> Entra ID
    OidcRoundtrip --> CookieIssued: callback -> HttpOnly + Secure cookie
    DevCookieIssued --> AuthChecking: /auth/me roundtrip
    CookieIssued --> AuthChecking: /auth/me roundtrip
    AuthChecking --> RedirectGuard: returnUrl is local path only
    RedirectGuard --> AuthenticatedLayout: 302 local path
    RedirectGuard --> LoginScreen: reject external path
    AuthenticatedLayout --> RouteResolve: Blazor Router
    RouteResolve --> GameShell: route matches Features/*
    RouteResolve --> NotFound: 404
    GameShell --> GameShell: Navigate within layout
    GameShell --> UnauthenticatedLayout: /auth/logout
    NotFound --> AuthenticatedLayout: back navigation